# AI Grammar Corrector - AI-Ready Environment
# Zero-configuration setup for AI Agents (Codex, OpenCode, Cursor, etc.)
#
# This configuration requires NO external services.
# The extension works immediately - users configure API keys in VS Code settings.

# =============================================================================
# LLM API Configuration (for testing only)
# =============================================================================

# Note: AI Agents should set API keys via environment secrets, not here.
# Required secrets for live testing:
#   - OPENROUTER_API_KEY or OPENAI_API_KEY

# Default API endpoint (OpenRouter - supports all major models)
# API_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions

# Default model (fast and cheap)
# MODEL=google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite

# =============================================================================
# No other configuration needed!
# =============================================================================
# This is a VS Code extension project with:
# - No database required
# - No cache service required
# - No Docker required
# - No external dependencies beyond npm packages
